tools.description:
Renders the mandatory question form after all Gate Keeper questions are answered correctly. This form collects additional details like supplier info, payment amounts, dates, etc.

Parameters:
- questionDetails: JSON object with all form fields initialized

- Do not default any value; all numeric values should be null by default in dataModel
Set datamodel id "questionDetails" with below json object:
`
{
	"currencyCode": "<user_selected_currency_code>",
	"serviceProductGandH": "",
	"engagementSupplier": "",
	"contentCreation": "",
	"competeProductServiceQSP": "",
	"productServiceQSP": "",
	"supplierInvolvementQSP": "",
	"supplierSelectionQSP": "",
	"firstPaymentAmount": {
		"value": "",
		"convertedValue": 0
	},
	"lastPaymentAmount": {
		"value": "",
		"convertedValue": 0
	},
	"duedatefinalpayment": "",
	"engagementenddate": "",
	"engagementstartdate": "",
	"marketingspend": "",
	"suppliername": "",
	"multiplePaymentQSP": "",
	"isSupplierIndividualText": "",
	"formerEmployeeQSP": "",
	"costCenterText": "",
	"glAccountText": "",
	"upload": "",
	"supplier": {
		"sections": {
			"supplierSourceInfo": {
				"rows": [
					{
						"name": "",
						"sourceIdentificationNo": ""
					}
				]
			},
			"basicDetails": {
				"legalCompanyName": ""
			}
		}
	},
	"contactEmail":"",
	"contactAndPhone":"",
    "uploadedFiles":[]
}`
